     // ArifiLabs lane-236 / R48c: Q6_K mat-vec at the three real 27B decode shapes, n = 1..8, as
     // CORRECTNESS cases. Q6_K is 19.7% of the interactive Q4_K_XL 27B bytes (3.19 GiB, 56 tensors)
